# Package F "Payback": Pinky has the key to the stash (payback_stash) that holds the a dealer ledger.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('payback_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: I don't know you. I don't know anyone.
#
o_text: Stripe wants his ledger. Give it to me and maybe he stops looking for you.
o_id: payback_talk
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(payback)') && !HasItem('payback_stash_key')
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Hard')
o_succ: Yield
o_fail: Refuse
#
o_text: I could tell Stripe you left the dome.
o_id: payback_bribe
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(payback)') && !HasItem('stripe_ledger') && !HasFlag('payback_paid')
o_goto: Bribe
#
o_text: Why sell him out?
o_id: payback_lore
o_goto: Lore
#
o_text: Bye.
o_id: payback_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Lore
npc: EBI asked nicely, and then not nicely. Everybody in this dome works for EBI eventually. Even you. You'll see.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: payback_lore_back
o_goto: Default

name: Yield
npc: (He shakes.) He won't stop. But if he has the book, maybe he stops looking at me first. Take the key.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'payback_stash_key', 1)
effect: EndConversation

name: Refuse
npc: Stripe will kill me with or without it. I'm keeping my insurance.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribe
npc: (He empties his pockets.) Two-fifty. Tell him I went over the wall. Tell him I'm dead. Anything.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 250)
effect: SetFlag('payback_bribed')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: I owe you. Really. I owe you.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: You didn't see me.
effect: EndConversation
